    {"type":"text","id":"third_party_text","x":1000,"y":515,"width":410,"height":186,"text":"普通第三方 DataLoader\n\napplication callback 只能补充：\nsupports_bit_exact_dataloader_resume(loader)\ndataloader_resume_contract(loader)\n\nFull DCP 不支持 replay + skip 回退\n\n⇒ 保存或恢复时立即失败","originalText":"普通第三方 DataLoader\n\napplication callback 只能补充：\nsupports_bit_exact_dataloader_resume(loader)\ndataloader_resume_contract(loader)\n\nFull DCP 不支持 replay + skip 回退\n\n⇒ 保存或恢复时立即失败","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":20010,"version":1,"versionNonce":21010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
